        "original_id": "20bb4fd3-5948-5c37-8ed6-235b4b86d905",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: Cowles Company\n- Channels/Stations: SWX Right Now, KHQ, KNDO, KNDU, KULR-TV\n- Networks: NBC\n- Places: Eastern Washington, Spokane, Yakima, Richland, Billings, Montana\n- Systems: Cable systems\n\nFacts:\n- SWX Right Now is operated by Cowles Company.\n- SWX Right Now airs over Cowles Company's three NBC-affiliated channels in Eastern Washington: KHQ in Spokane, KNDO in Yakima, and KNDU in Richland.\n- SWX Right Now also airs on KULR in Billings, Montana, and on most cable systems throughout the markets those stations serve.\n- KULR-TV is an NBC affiliate in Billings, Montana.\n- KULR-TV uses virtual channel 8 and broadcasts on channel 11.",
